            <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Investor guidance</p><h1>Invest with confidence across Ghana.</h1><p>Follow the complete journey from opportunity discovery to a reviewed investor profile.</p></div>
            <div class="guide-hero__meta"><strong>Investor guide</strong><span>Public reference</span><small>Updated {{ now()->format('F Y') }}</small></div>
